[0m│ [0;1m←/→              [0mChange a horizontal choice, expand, or go back according to focus.                                                                                             [0m│[179C[0;48;5;248m [0m
[0m│ [0;1mTab / Shift-Tab  [0mMove focus between visible surfaces.                                                                                                                           [0m│[179C[0;48;5;248m [0m
[0m│ [0;1mEnter            [0mOpen, select, or submit the focused action.                                                                                                                    [0m│[179C[0;48;5;248m [0m
[0m│ [0;1mH                [0mOpen or hide Help from a session's read-only navigation surface.                                                                                               [0m│[179C[0;48;5;248m [0m
[0m│ [0;1mEsc / Backspace  [0mGo back one layer; Backspace edits text in writable fields.                                                                                                    [0m│[179C[0;48;5;248m [0m
